IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ea-cpc-interface`
IMPORT `ea-types`
IMPORT `ea-bankers-schedules`
IMPORT `ea-goals`

-- Tests for ea-bankers-schedules.l4 (ss 170 to 176, First and Second Schedules) and ea-goals.l4 (the principal questions
-- and the conclusions the Evidence Act hands the Criminal Procedure Code).
-- Expected values are read off the Act's text and illustrations.  Generated by generators/ea_tests_3.py.

`the Code says the notice conditions are met and sections 265 and 266 do not apply` MEANS `Code Conclusions` WITH
    `the notice requirements and other conditions prescribed under section 428 of the Criminal Procedure Code 2010 are complied with` IS TRUE
    `evidence of the fact is admissible by virtue of section 265 or 266 of the Criminal Procedure Code 2010` IS FALSE
`the Code says sections 265 or 266 make the evidence admissible` MEANS `Code Conclusions` WITH
    `the notice requirements and other conditions prescribed under section 428 of the Criminal Procedure Code 2010 are complied with` IS FALSE
    `evidence of the fact is admissible by virtue of section 265 or 266 of the Criminal Procedure Code 2010` IS TRUE

`s172 an ordinary book of the bank` MEANS `Bankers Books Facts` WITH
    `the book was, at the time of the making of the entry, one of the ordinary books of the bank` IS TRUE
    `the entry was made in the usual and ordinary course of business` IS TRUE
    `the book is in the custody or control of the bank` IS TRUE
    `the copy has been examined with the original entry and is correct` IS TRUE
    `the bank is a party to the legal proceeding` IS FALSE
    `a judge has ordered the production or attendance for special cause` IS FALSE
    `the company carries on the business of bankers in Singapore under a licence granted under a law relating to banking` IS TRUE

`s171 an unlicensed company` MEANS `Bankers Books Facts` WITH
    `the book was, at the time of the making of the entry, one of the ordinary books of the bank` IS TRUE
    `the entry was made in the usual and ordinary course of business` IS TRUE
    `the book is in the custody or control of the bank` IS TRUE
    `the copy has been examined with the original entry and is correct` IS TRUE
    `the bank is a party to the legal proceeding` IS FALSE
    `a judge has ordered the production or attendance for special cause` IS FALSE
    `the company carries on the business of bankers in Singapore under a licence granted under a law relating to banking` IS FALSE

`s172 not made in the ordinary course` MEANS `Bankers Books Facts` WITH
    `the book was, at the time of the making of the entry, one of the ordinary books of the bank` IS TRUE
    `the entry was made in the usual and ordinary course of business` IS FALSE
    `the book is in the custody or control of the bank` IS TRUE
    `the copy has been examined with the original entry and is correct` IS TRUE
    `the bank is a party to the legal proceeding` IS FALSE
    `a judge has ordered the production or attendance for special cause` IS FALSE
    `the company carries on the business of bankers in Singapore under a licence granted under a law relating to banking` IS FALSE

`s173 a copy not examined with the original` MEANS `Bankers Books Facts` WITH
    `the book was, at the time of the making of the entry, one of the ordinary books of the bank` IS TRUE
    `the entry was made in the usual and ordinary course of business` IS TRUE
    `the book is in the custody or control of the bank` IS TRUE
    `the copy has been examined with the original entry and is correct` IS FALSE
    `the bank is a party to the legal proceeding` IS FALSE
    `a judge has ordered the production or attendance for special cause` IS FALSE
    `the company carries on the business of bankers in Singapore under a licence granted under a law relating to banking` IS FALSE

`s174 a bank that is not a party` MEANS `Bankers Books Facts` WITH
    `the book was, at the time of the making of the entry, one of the ordinary books of the bank` IS FALSE
    `the entry was made in the usual and ordinary course of business` IS FALSE
    `the book is in the custody or control of the bank` IS FALSE
    `the copy has been examined with the original entry and is correct` IS FALSE
    `the bank is a party to the legal proceeding` IS FALSE
    `a judge has ordered the production or attendance for special cause` IS FALSE
    `the company carries on the business of bankers in Singapore under a licence granted under a law relating to banking` IS TRUE

`s174 a bank that is a party` MEANS `Bankers Books Facts` WITH
    `the book was, at the time of the making of the entry, one of the ordinary books of the bank` IS FALSE
    `the entry was made in the usual and ordinary course of business` IS FALSE
    `the book is in the custody or control of the bank` IS FALSE
    `the copy has been examined with the original entry and is correct` IS FALSE
    `the bank is a party to the legal proceeding` IS TRUE
    `a judge has ordered the production or attendance for special cause` IS FALSE
    `the company carries on the business of bankers in Singapore under a licence granted under a law relating to banking` IS FALSE

`s174 a judge orders for special cause` MEANS `Bankers Books Facts` WITH
    `the book was, at the time of the making of the entry, one of the ordinary books of the bank` IS FALSE
    `the entry was made in the usual and ordinary course of business` IS FALSE
    `the book is in the custody or control of the bank` IS FALSE
    `the copy has been examined with the original entry and is correct` IS FALSE
    `the bank is a party to the legal proceeding` IS FALSE
    `a judge has ordered the production or attendance for special cause` IS TRUE
    `the company carries on the business of bankers in Singapore under a licence granted under a law relating to banking` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `the book is proved to be a banker's book under section 172` `s172 an ordinary book of the bank`

#ASSERT NOT `the book is proved to be a banker's book under section 172` `s172 not made in the ordinary course`

#ASSERT `the copy is proved to be a verified copy under section 173` `s172 an ordinary book of the bank`

#ASSERT NOT `the copy is proved to be a verified copy under section 173` `s173 a copy not examined with the original`

#ASSERT `the copy of the entry is received as prima facie evidence of the entry and of the matters recorded` `s172 an ordinary book of the bank`

#ASSERT NOT `the copy of the entry is received as prima facie evidence of the entry and of the matters recorded` `s172 not made in the ordinary course`

-- Found by the independent test pass (tests-independent.l4, K4): s 170 defines a bank as a licensed company, so s 171 does not reach an unlicensed one.

#ASSERT NOT `the copy of the entry is received as prima facie evidence of the entry and of the matters recorded` `s171 an unlicensed company`

#ASSERT NOT `the copy of the entry is received as prima facie evidence of the entry and of the matters recorded` `s173 a copy not examined with the original`

#ASSERT `the company is a bank` `s174 a bank that is not a party`

#ASSERT NOT `the officer of the bank is compellable to produce the book or appear under section 174` `s174 a bank that is not a party`

#ASSERT `the officer of the bank is compellable to produce the book or appear under section 174` `s174 a bank that is a party`

#ASSERT `the officer of the bank is compellable to produce the book or appear under section 174` `s174 a judge orders for special cause`

