    `the section number` IS "147"
    `the offence is an attempt to commit, an abetment of, or being a party to a criminal conspiracy to commit, an offence in the Schedule` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `the class of the offence under the First Schedule` `WC s 147` EQUALS `a sexual offence`

